WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.293
Every client meeting ends the same way.

2
00:00:05.293 --> 00:00:07.586
Hours of typing it all into Intelliflo.

3
00:00:07.586 --> 00:00:09.600
Over two hundred hours a year.

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
So we built the Fact Find Writer.

5
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.542
Put in everything from the meeting.

6
00:00:14.542 --> 00:00:16.392
The transcript, the handwritten fact find,

7
00:00:16.392 --> 00:00:16.876
the photos,

8
00:00:16.876 --> 00:00:18.580
even the voice note from the car.

9
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.760
About a minute later, the whole fact find is ready to check.

10
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.416
It follows the conversation.

11
00:00:31.416 --> 00:00:34.652
Where the paperwork and the meeting disagree, it shows you both.

12
00:00:34.652 --> 00:00:37.380
And if a figure was never given, it waits for it.

13
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.410
Check it, approve it, and it's written straight into Intelliflo.

14
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:57.068
That's over two hundred hours a year back,

15
00:00:57.068 --> 00:00:59.090
for the work only an adviser can do.

16
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.042
The meeting ends.

17
00:01:09.042 --> 00:01:11.070
And the typing doesn't start.
